---
name: nth
---

# nth

The cell at a zero-based index — a thin wrapper over the `list_nth`
primitive. Indexing outside the list panics; callers guard with `len`.

```soil-sig
nth : (xs : List F64) -> (i : I64) -> panic F64
```

```requires
in-bounds: i >= 0 and i < len(xs)
```

```test picks
([1.0, 2.5, 3.0], 0) => 1.0
([1.0, 2.5, 3.0], 2) => 3.0
```

```test out-of-range
([1.0], 5) => panic
```
